    english: "It is better to live in this world by begging than to slay these great noble souls who are my teachers. If I kill them, even though they desire worldly gain, everything I enjoy will be stained with blood.",
    hindi: "इन महानुभाव गुरुओं को मारने की अपेक्षा इस लोक में भिक्षा का अन्न खाना भी श्रेष्ठ है। यदि मैं इन्हें मार भी दूँ तो उनके रक्त से रंगे हुए भोगों को ही भोगूँगा।",
    meaning: "Arjuna would rather beg for food than slay his teachers. He sees no victory in wealth or pleasure gained by killing those he loves and respects.",
    keywords: ["teachers", "begging", "blood", "sacrifice", "guilt"],
    moodTags: ["grief", "moral conflict", "helplessness"]
