    meaning: "Krishna names the specific great warriors — Drona (teacher), Bhishma (grandfather), Jayadratha, and Karna — declaring all are already slain in cosmic time. He commands Arjuna to act without grief. Victory is already decided. This verse contains one of the most liberating truths in spiritual philosophy: the outcome is already in God's hands.",
