    meaning: "Arjuna begins his great prayer. He observes the dual reaction to the cosmic form: the virtuous (siddhas) bow in devotion while the demonic forces (rakshasas) flee in terror. This reveals a cosmic truth — the divine brings joy and devotion to the good and fear to those aligned with darkness.",
